		(uuid "36e2c557-2c2a-4fba-9b6f-1167ab8ec281")
	)
	(text "TURBO ENABLE BUFFER (GPIO17)\n4N35 alone cannot sink the enable current (~15-30mA).\nQ2 does the switching; opto only isolates."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 163.576 110.866 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5413f79b-7f4c-4f74-9e7b-f8b04761d215")
	)
	(text "ID_SD and ID_SC PINS:\nThese pins are reserved for HAT ID EEPROM.\n\nAt boot time this I2C interface will be\ninterrogated to look for an EEPROM\nthat identifes the attached board and\nallows automagic setup of the GPIOs\n(and optionally, Linux drivers).\n\nBridging JP1 enables write protection.\n\nDO NOT USE these pins for anything other\nthan attaching an I2C ID EEPROM. Leave\nunconnected if ID EEPROM not required."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16.51 193.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8714082a-55fe-4a29-9d48-99ae1ef73073")
	)
	(text "JST XH CONNECTORS (2.50mm)\nJ8 UART: energy meter, 3.3V TTL ONLY\nJ9 MFC: setpoint + flow feedback\nJ10 Pirani, J11 turbo RPM (0-5V, R12/R13 divide to 3.3V max on A2)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 189.738 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "892da2c7-c3d6-4b0a-a336-d8bd7e0fc46f")
	)
	(text "TURBO VALVE RELAY (GPIO22)\nValve on COM+NC: fails CLOSED on power loss.\nVERIFY NC/NO pins with meter before wiring valve.\nSolenoid needs its own flyback diode AT THE VALVE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 163.576 65.786 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8fb910f0-31fa-4cd2-babe-3e8cb60ed711")
	)
	(text "DAC BUFFER\nLM358 from 5V: output covers full 0-3.3V range.\nUnused unit B: inputs floating (acceptable)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 109.474 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ebfc4cd3-63f3-429e-939d-9cd0d40c7ff8")
	)
